  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDF Grant for Support for the Establishment of a Financial and Management Control Board (FMCB) for Nairobi City Council (NCC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grart will finance the activities of the current Interim Oversight Board (NIOB)        that has been appointed over the Nairobi City Council ,,   for a period of about 5 months.   The NIOB will start the process of restoring financial order to the NCC until a full Financial and Management Control Board can be established.  The major component of the grant will go to finance consultancies to provide the needed technical expertise to support the members of the Board.  The grant will also finance the professional fees of the 3 private sector appointees to the Board.  The logistical support for the NIOB will be financed from the counterpart funds provided by the Government.</narrative>
  </description>
